          "why": "LlamaRisk and Llama Risk proposals to cut WBTC LTV to zero on Aave represented the practical risk-management debate readers wanted to follow in real time."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "WBTC supply collapse",
          "why": "The disappearance of over 86,000 WBTC from circulation in a single year was a measurable signal of market-wide loss of confidence that readers found alarming."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Wrapped BTC alternatives emerging",
          "why": "cbBTC, dlcBTC, and swBTC all surfaced as credible replacements precisely because the custody controversy created demand for trust-minimized or non-custodial alternatives."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "HTX proof-of-reserves opacity",
